#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD1362-A expect=skipped domain=DM
#note "THE ALL-FACET GATE, PINNED AT THE MINT. This sibling's Check is empty(ACTARM) and a populated ACTARMCD, so on a DM without the ACTARM column every ACTARMCD-populated row would fire. Requirements.Variables.All [ACTARMCD, ACTARM] rejects the dataset instead - the \u00a74 pin, recorded in documentation/derivation/absent-column-verdicts.tsv. If this scenario EXECUTES, the gate has been removed: escalate, do not rewrite the pin."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset DM class="SPECIAL PURPOSE" label="Demographics"
col STUDYID  type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN   type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID  type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col ACTARMCD type=Char label="Actual Arm Code"
---
S1 | DM | 001 | B
